ion_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:e978ea41ab8fe8917885e99b49a5cc8765de5a5cb326f8e6e75c15501e7181a2","file":"preprints/Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":37,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"6db10a63f075e7db2b8635f5a58c5d527f2912b2a50984a484efa5b73c3e950b","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:e978ea41ab8fe8917885e99b49a5cc8765de5a5cb326f8e6e75c15501e7181a2","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L37"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:gibbs-start}\nFor every deterministic sequence $t_n\\ge0$ with $t_n=o(n^{2/3})$,\n\\[\n \\mu_W\\{x:d_{t_n}^{\\rm ct}(W,x)>1/4\\}\n \\xrightarrow{\\Prob}1.\n\\]\nFor every deterministic integer sequence $k_n\\ge0$ with $k_n=o(n^{5/3})$,\n\\[\n \\mu_W\\{x:d_{k_n}^{\\rm dt}(W,x)>1/4\\}\n \\xrightarrow{\\Prob}1.\n\\]\nThe convergence is in probability over the disorder."}
